    oe:aboutDisease oed:parkinson_disease ;
    oe:answerText "Gut dysbiosis and gut-brain-axis involvement in people with Parkinson's disease (PwP) support the use of gut-microbiota-modulating interventions. Probiotics may help manage constipation in PwP; however, mechanisms underpinning additional beneficial properties are unknown."^^xsd:string ;
